This subpackage contains Github Monaspace.

The Monaspace type system is a monospaced type superfamily with some 
modern tricks up its sleeves. It is comprised of five variable axis 
typefaces. Each one has a distinct voice, but they are all 
metrics-compatible with one another, allowing you to mix and match them 
for a more expressive typographical palette.

For more information have a look at the upstream website: 
https://github.com/githubnext/monaspace
